type: dataset
title: "Yumaxa on-board charger catalogue"
abstract: "Four TLCZ on-board sealed battery charger series (Tianli New Energy brand) and their 24 printed model rows, transcribed from the product tables on the manufacturer's website. Values pending confirmation are left out; where the Chinese and English pages differ, the Chinese value is given. Products and data source: Anhui Tianli New Energy Co., Ltd., the manufacturer. License: not yet stated by the manufacturer; data as published on its website."
